    "detailed_description": "A golf game where speed matters!<br><br>You are scored by your shots + time.<br><br>The lowest score wins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Types</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Battle Royale</strong>: 3 holes, the slowest half of the field is eliminated. Winner on the last hole.<br></li><li><strong>Shootout</strong>: 18 holes, 19 people tee off, slowest player drops off each hole.<br></li><li><strong>Duos</strong>:  Alternate shots with a partner.<br></li><li><strong>Tournaments</strong>: Post your score </li></ul>",
